OL,3,GNEWSAZoo advertises tickets for 'child
OL,4,Apredator tour'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA zoo has blamed a computer error after
OL,7,Fit advertised a "child predator tour"
OL,8,Fonline to see its tigers and lions.
OL,10,FBosses at Chester Zoo quickly changed
OL,11,Fthe 90-minute bus tour's name after it
OL,12,Fwas branded "sinister" by visitors.
OL,14,FA zoo spokeswoman said the error was
OL,15,F"due to our default naming convention
OL,16,Fin our system", but it was "quickly
OL,17,Fchanged".
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
